OL,3,AFather leaves 7-year-old son alone on
OL,4,AMount Fuji to continue hike, reports
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FA father has been reprimanded by police
OL,8,Fafter leaving his son on Japan's
OL,9,Fhighest mountain for several hours with
OL,10,Fjust a soft drink and snack, local
OL,11,Fmedia report.
OL,13,FThe seven-year-old was spotted sitting
OL,14,Fon a bench on Mount Fuji in foggy and
OL,15,Frainy conditions, at a point situated
OL,16,Fat over 2,000m (6,500ft).
OL,18,FHis father, 48, reportedly told him to
OL,19,F"wait here" after the boy complained he
OL,20,Fwas tired - and continued the climb
OL,21,Fwith his elder son.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
