OL,3,AFather leaves 7-year-old son alone on
OL,4,AMount Fuji to continue hike, reports
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FStaff at a mountain hut found the child
OL,8,Fnear the sixth station of a hiking
OL,9,Froute towards the summit and alerted
OL,10,Fpolice. His father was tracked down at
OL,11,Fthe route's eighth station - said to be
OL,12,Fa three-hour hike away.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
